# Keep the build context small, and keep secrets and local data OUT of images.
.git
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.next-turnstile-e2e
**/dist
**/coverage
.legion-testdb
backups
*.zip
*.md
docs

# Secrets: never baked into an image. Configuration reaches the containers
# through docker-compose environment variables instead.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.local.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.legion-setup-token
